    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"RestClientResponseException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\">RestClientResponseException</a></code> - by default when receiving a\nresponse with a status code of 4xx or 5xx. Use\n<a href=\"#onStatus(java.util.function.Predicate,org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler)\"><code>onStatus(Predicate, ErrorHandler)</code></a> to customize error response\nhandling.",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"RestClientResponseException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\">RestClientResponseException</a></code> - 默认情况下，当接收到状态码为 4xx 或 5xx 的响应时。使用<a href=\"#onStatus(java.util.function.Predicate,org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.ResponseSpec.ErrorHandler)\"><code>onStatus(Predicate, ErrorHandler)</code></a>来自定义错误响应处理。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <code>ResponseEntity</code> with the body decoded to an Object of\nthe given type.",
      "translation": "返回一个<code>ResponseEntity</code>，其主体已解码为给定类型的对象。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Extract the body as an object of the given type.",
      "translation": "提取主体为给定类型的对象。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>IOExceptions</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/UncheckedIOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>UncheckedIOExceptions</code></a>, and\n<a href=\"../../http/converter/HttpMessageNotReadableException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageNotReadableExceptions</code></a>\nthrown from <code>errorHandler</code> will be wrapped in a\n<a href=\"RestClientException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClientException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注意，从 `errorHandler` 抛出的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>IOExceptions</code></a>`、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/UncheckedIOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>UncheckedIOExceptions</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../http/converter/HttpMessageNotReadableException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageNotReadableExceptions</code></a> 将被包装在 `<a href=\"RestClientException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClientException</code></a>` 中。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, if there are no matching status handlers, responses with\nstatus codes &gt;= 400 will throw a <a href=\"RestClientResponseException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClientResponseException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，如果没有匹配的状态处理器，状态码 >= 400 的响应将抛出<a href=\"RestClientResponseException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClientResponseException</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
